messages[14]{user,text}:
  user_1,Hi is this DCoders
  user_2,Ah yes this is Ramesh from Safe Shield Agency representing DCoders How can I assist you today
  user_1,I am Pranav Mishra I have a health policy with you guys and I am trying to understand the status of my policy
  user_2,Okay Pranav can you please provide me with your policy number so I can look into this for you
  user_1,It's HP-001234
  user_2,Alright let me just check on that for you [typing] Ah yes I see that your policy HP-001234 is currently showing as expired
  user_1,Expired What do you mean It was supposed to be active till the end of the year
  user_2,I apologize for the inconvenience Pranav It seems that the payment for the renewal was not processed successfully [background noise: dog barks]
  user_1,But I did make the payment I have the receipt right here
  user_2,I apologize for the mistake Let me see what I can do to assist you further [hold music starts playing]
  user_2,[hold music ends] Ah sorry about the wait Pranav I've checked on the payment and it seems that it was indeed made but there was an issue with the processing
  user_1,So what does this mean for my policy
  user_2,Well we can reinstate your policy but you will need to pay the premium for the current month as well
  user_1,Okay that sounds good How do I go about doing that